DOMAIN,opencloud.wostore.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN,enrichgw.10010.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,hmrz.wo.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN,id.mail.wo.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN,mdn.open.wo.cn,REJECT

